    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 26</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be ðeofan. ⁊ gesece se ebǽra ðeof þæt he sece, oððe se ðe on hlafordsearwe gemet sy, þæt hi næfre feorh ne gesecan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning thieves. And the proved thief and he who has been discovered in treason against his lord, whatever sanctuary he seeks, shall never be able to save his life.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gesece se ebǽra þeof þæt þæt he gesece, oððe se ðe on hlafordsearwe gemet sig, þæt hig næfre feorh ne gesecean.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
